<section class="svr-intro" aria-labelledby="svr-intro-heading">
	<div class="svr-intro__inner">
		<h2 id="svr-intro-heading"><a href="/eye-hospital-in-tirur/" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">Eye Hospital in Tirur</a>, Malappuram District</h2>
		<p><strong>Sampada VR Speciality Eye Care</strong> is on Railway Station Bypass Road, Thazhepalam, a few minutes from Tirur railway station and the bus stand. Opened in December 2020, it is the first centre in the Malabar region dedicated to vitreoretinal disease, and is led by <a href="/about-dr-sameera-v-v/">Dr Sameera V V</a>, a vitreoretinal surgeon with 14 years of experience.</p>
		<p>We treat retinal detachment, diabetic retinopathy, macular degeneration and retinopathy of prematurity (ROP), alongside cataract surgery, glaucoma care, squint, low vision and myopia control. Diagnosis is done in-house with <a href="/blog/oct-essential-eye-exam-tool/">OCT</a>, <a href="/blog/diabetic-retinopathy-retinal-imaging/">fundus imaging</a> and the <a href="/blog/humphrey-field-analyzer-glaucoma-detection/">Humphrey Field Analyzer</a>, so most patients get an answer on the same visit.</p>
		<p>Patients travel to us from Tirur, Tanur, Kottakkal, Valanchery, Parappanangadi and across Malappuram district. Open Monday to Saturday; call <a href="tel:+919188572412">+91 91885 72412</a> to book an appointment.</p>
	</div>
</section>
